      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "No. Writing the ISO creates bootable live media. MiniOS Installer can deploy"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "either a modular live system with optional persistence or a conventional native"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "system. Choose a layout with "
