          "write and boot method."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "heading",
      2,
      "what-is-the-difference-between-the-active-and-running-session",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "What is the difference between the active and running session?"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "The active session is selected for the next boot; conceptually, the running"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "session supplies persistence now. The persistent "
        ],
        [
          "span",
          "code",
          [
            [
              "text",
              "running="
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " record can be stale"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "after a crash, so protected current-boot state and the mounted writable layer"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "are authoritative for runtime operations. Activating a session does not switch"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "the current system. See "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/configuration/Session-Management.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Session"
            ],
            [
              "text",
              "\n"
            ],
            [
              "text",
              "management"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "link",
          "/configuration/Initrd-Persistence.md",
          null,
          [
            [
              "text",
              "Initrd"
            ],
            [
              "text",
              "\n"
            ],
            [
              "text",
              "persistence"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "."
        ]
      ]
