          "text",
          "Should I install software with APT or as a module?"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Use APT to modify one running system or persistent session. Use modules for"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "read-only software layers loaded at boot. Compare the effects and storage"
        ],
        [
          "text",
          "\n"
